	text: [
		"The bloomery takes fuel, and either ores or slag to create blooms.",
		"",
		"Insert the ore or slag into the top of the bloomery.",
		"",
		"Then right click it with fuel (for example sulfur). ",
		"",
		"Then right click the top with either a fire starter or an octine ingot to light it up. ",
		"",
		"It can take quite a while to create the bloom, but this process can be sped up later on.",
		"",
		"You only need 1 fuel item per operation, but the more you use, the faster it processes items."
